Package: clink
Version: 1.0.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: chriz-3656 <chriz-3656@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-websockets, python3-cairo, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-xlib, python3-qrcode, python3-pil, adb
Description: Android-powered drawing tablet and desktop annotation system for Linux
 Clink turns Android devices into wireless or USB drawing tablets and desktop
 annotation canvases with real-time transparent overlays and input injection.
